 "key_insight": "Pets4Homes answers every Staffy search with one templated listing page per breed and place, and each page is a feed of other sellers' adverts: health tests, KC papers and ready dates appear only when a seller happens to type them, and the page's own price answer is a national average. BSUK can beat it on the same query with one breeder's facts in one place (named tests, licence, litter dates and a printed price) on a page a buyer can act on."
